        "text": "Jeff Walter has been the mayor of Elburn since 2017 and was a village trustee from 2009 to 2017. He is a retired U.S. Navy Master Chief Petty Officer and a former senior manager at Accenture. He is a retired IT consultant and has served as a Blackberry Township precinct committee person.",
